WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
A class of thirty students.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.170
Hands up if you play football.

3
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.500
Eighteen hands.

4
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.890
Hands up for tennis.

5
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:07.880
Fifteen.

6
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:10.420
And four students play neither.

7
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.370
But wait.

8
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.930
Eighteen plus fifteen is thirty-three.

9
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.550
That's more students
than are in the class!

10
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.210
So some students must play both.

11
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.310
How many?

12
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.130
In this mission, you'll
draw Venn diagrams:

13
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.800
a rectangle for everything,
and a circle for each set.

14
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:31.370
You'll shade the union, the intersection
and the complement of two sets.

15
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.080
And you'll list the elements
of a set, in curly brackets.

16
00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:40.670
Your mission: find how many of the thirty
students play both football and tennis.
